Mr. Whiskers was a black and white mottled catfolk. He used to live on the streets of [[Geography/Calaria/Hallia/Sableclutch/index|Sableclutch]], and was a proud member of the [[Anti-Zorbon Taskforce|Anti-Zorbon Taskforce]], which met in the sewers underneath [[Geography/Calaria/Hallia/Widdershins/index|Widdershins]].

He was called the head of the taskforce, and the honey seller [[People/Cora Honeysap|Cora Honeysap]] knew him by that role. His bundle of things and his folded tinfoil hats remain in the taskforce's wrecked hideout.

He was slain and used in a necromantic ritual by [[Benjamin Grayson]]. His upper half lies within the ritual circle in Grayson's private study.
